WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.340
My name is  Hank Green and this is a message to the graduating class of 2009.

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:05.300
Have a pinata!

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.980
[girl hits the head off a pinata] Ohhhh! My god!

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:12.040
Elementary school, middle school, high school, college, and graduate school.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:13.280
I've graduated five times.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:18.480
So I'm a bit of an expert on the subject. No matter what you just graduated from you are about to go change the

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:23.720
world. You have a lot more learning to do, we welcome you with open arms into the real world!

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:26.420
Graduation speeches, they all sound like this!

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:29.700
I think mostly what I want to say is: "Do not trust anyone

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:33.200
who is telling you the way the world is going to be for you."

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:38.489
I graduated from college with a major in biochemistry, and now I'm professional internet moron.

00:00:38.489 --> 00:00:44.279
Let's be honest with ourselves here, things are changing rather quickly - the advantage that you have is not all the stuff

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:45.789
you just learned. You need that,

00:00:45.789 --> 00:00:50.549
don't get me wrong, but everybody else has it too. The advantage that you have is a whole new world

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:52.800
just got discovered and you grew up there.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:57.390
I'm in my 20s. People my age do not understand the world the way you do.

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.160
It's like there was a first generation of people who were born in America.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:04.860
You're like that except you're the first generation of people who were born on the internet.

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:10.409
Don't ask me how your mom did that, but she did, and it is not just that you know how to utilize this stuff.

00:01:10.409 --> 00:01:10.990
Oh,

00:01:10.990 --> 00:01:15.860
Timmy knows what Facebook is. He hangs out on 4Chan and discusses memes.

00:01:15.860 --> 00:01:18.200
That is how you should try and convey it to your elders

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:22.380
but that is not your actual advantage. More than a conception of how it works, you have a completely different

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:28.580
perception of how the world works. The days when people could be satisfied being the expert in a mere one field are over my friends.

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:33.800
You all, and I think you know this, are going to have to be the men and women of the new Renaissance. New

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:39.750
Renaissance men and women, be ready to do everything and when no one asks you to do it for them, be ready to do it

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:43.440
for yourself! So that's where you're at now friends. I suggest you enjoy it.

